      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="owner-hero-panel">
      <span class="owner-panel-label">What owners want fixed</span>
      <h2>Less fee drag. More clarity.</h2>
      <p>The strongest owners usually are not shopping for a prettier brochure. They are trying to figure out whether the current manager is protecting premium nights, reducing commission leakage, and operating close enough to the home to prevent expensive misses.</p>
      <ul class="owner-panel-list">
        <li><span class="owner-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>10-15% management fees instead of the 20-35% owner take common in the local comp set</span></li>
        <li><span class="owner-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Pricing decisions tied to real demand, seasonality, and market position instead of blanket discounts</span></li>
        <li><span class="owner-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Local operating response that protects reviews, repeat stays, and owner margin</span></li>
